    {
      "description": "ReScript Package Index To discover libraries and bindings for ReScript, please use the official package index tool. Libraries with the keyword in their will appear there, as well as manually added resources. If you happen to find no bindings for a library, please ask for it on the forum. Chances are that somebody already wrote them, but kept them private, because maintaining a full set of bindings is always harder than tweaking them to one's specific needs.\nIf no bindings exist yet, you can generate a starting point from the library's TypeScript types with rescript-bindgen — a deterministic → ReScript binding generator (type-safe, no ), which you then tweak to your needs.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "Libraries and Bindings"
